{"id":"n15327-1-8","stage":3,"title":"가로등 · 路灯","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15327-1-8-1","ko":"여기 종이에 뭐라고 적힌 거야?","zh":"这里纸上写的是什么呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"종이에","meaning":"纸，纸片","explanation":"종이：纸，纸片；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"종이","audio":"/audio/8879faff5daebd510706.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75802","senseId":"1","lemma":"종이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐라고","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"적힌","meaning":"被写下","explanation":"적히다：被写下；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"적히다","audio":"/audio/7998eec620b7e3cc03ff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25069","senseId":"1","lemma":"적히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"那个","explanation":"거：那个；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66342","senseId":"2","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"8879faff5daebd51","term":"종이","zh":"纸，纸片","audio":"/audio/8879faff5daebd510706.mp3","entryId":"75802","definition":"以木材为原料制成薄片，用于写字、绘画、印刷等诸多方面的东西。","pronunciation":["종이"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"7998eec620b7e3cc","term":"적히다","zh":"被写下","audio":"/audio/7998eec620b7e3cc03ff.mp3","entryId":"25069","definition":"被用文字记下来。","pronunciation":["저키다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"66342","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/cddcc00b8b6f0af1bfb4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15327-1-8-2","ko":"어두워서 잘 안 보이니까 가로등 아래로 가서 보자.","zh":"太暗了看不清楚，我们到路灯下面去看看吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어두워서","meaning":"暗，黑暗","explanation":"어둡다：暗，黑暗；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"어둡다","audio":"/audio/ced8d3736f75b7c367ac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89860","senseId":"1","lemma":"어둡다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"清楚地，仔细地","explanation":"잘：清楚地，仔细地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"2","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보이니까","meaning":"可见，看得到","explanation":"보이다：可见，看得到；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"3","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가로등","meaning":"路灯，街灯","explanation":"가로등：路灯，街灯","readings":[{"term":"가로등","audio":"/audio/029b1bfcc0849ac4e7e2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15327","senseId":"1","lemma":"가로등","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아래로","meaning":"下，下面","explanation":"아래：下，下面；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"아래","audio":"/audio/8f2ea9820639f8b85047.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71288","senseId":"1","lemma":"아래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가서","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보자.","meaning":"照，看","explanation":"보다：照，看；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"25","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ced8d3736f75b7c3","term":"어둡다","zh":"暗，黑暗","audio":"/audio/ced8d3736f75b7c367ac.mp3","entryId":"89860","definition":"没有光或光线很弱而不亮。","pronunciation":["어둡따"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"清楚地，仔细地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"分明而准确地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"可见，看得到","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"某种结果出来。","pronunciation":["보이다"]},{"id":"029b1bfcc0849ac4","term":"가로등","zh":"路灯，街灯","audio":"/audio/029b1bfcc0849ac4e7e2.mp3","entryId":"15327","definition":"设在路上，用来照明的灯。","pronunciation":["가로등"]},{"id":"8f2ea9820639f8b8","term":"아래","zh":"下，下面","audio":"/audio/8f2ea9820639f8b85047.mp3","entryId":"71288","definition":"比一定基准低的位置。","pronunciation":["아래"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"照，看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"为了了解某对象的内容或状态而进行观察。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f460276329f522cdbb05.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.105,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15327","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":113,"sequenceScore":2.9317,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["太暗了看不清楚，我们到路灯下面去看看吧。","这里纸上写的是什么呀？","你觉得凭你的直觉，这次考试会怎么样？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这里纸上写的是什么呀？","你觉得凭你的直觉，这次考试会怎么样？","太暗了看不清楚，我们到路灯下面去看看吧。"],"answer":2}]}
